<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87501" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθέλυμνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέλυμνον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from the foundations, from</i> or <i>by the roots,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθελύμνους ἕλκετο χαίτας</span> he
			tore his hair out <i>by the roots,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.411
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθέλυμνα χαμαὶ βάλε
			δένδρεα</span> he threw to earth trees <i>uprooted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.541
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφόρει τὰς δρῦς . . προθελύμνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					528
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθέλυμνόν μ᾽ ἀπώλεσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1210
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				6.331
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				397
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> perh.
				<i>close-packed,</i> of shields <i>overlapping</i> in the
			phalanx, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράξαντες σάκος σάκεϊ προθελύμνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.130
				</span></i>
			; expld. by Gramm. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάλληλος, συνεχής</span>
			, and so used by <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				22.183
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρην προθέλυμνον
				ἐπασσυτέρῃ θέτο πέτρῃ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.374
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
